(F4 T6d C11, default group_truss_memory without materi_displacement
 (velocity-integrated truss). Node 2 moves by (-0.5, 1): the truss rotates
 and stretches. The Professional 02-08-2026 gives the -updated_linear
 result without a group_truss_memory record (force -50 along the initial
 axis, node 2 rhside velx +50); explicit -updated gives 10.4587. Old GNU
 default: -updated.)
echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 2
materi_velocity
materi_velocity_integrated
end_initia
node 1 0 0
node 2 1 0
element 1 -truss 1 2
group_type 0 -truss
group_truss_area 0 1.
group_truss_elasti_young 0 100.
bounda_dof 1 1 -velx -vely
bounda_dof 2 2 -velx
bounda_time 2 0. -0.5 1. -0.5
bounda_dof 3 2 -vely
bounda_time 3 0. 1. 1. 1.
control_timestep 10 0.1 1.
target_item 0 -node_rhside 2 -velx
target_value 0 50. 1.e-6
target_item 1 -node_rhside 2 -vely
target_value 1 0. 1.e-6
end_data
